  "gaps": [
    "No wreck _x/_xx creation step (copy model, keep bone names, check match); step: /models route 'make broken view' + bone-match lint",
    "No LOD class editor for level_of_detail*.set; step: read-only table first, then gen op lodclass",
    "bone uv shiftv animation (tracks) not in tree ops; step: bone.set {uv}",
    "Sequence options dynamicspeed / blend / pose not in seq.set; step: add to seq.set schema",
    "preview extender not edited in Models (see icon census); step: shared op preview.set",
    "No .anm from scratch beyond anm.new (keys) and Blender; step: anm import from Blender add-on output check in Art",
    "bone.terminator, speed2, def.zclipvisibility meaning [I]; step: q.js lookup + one in-game test each",
    "wreck count limit in entitymanager.set key not traced [I]; step: q.js -k entitymanager"
  ]
